{"4308440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zombie Defense:Breach of The Undead", "steam_appid": 4308440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Zombie Defense: Breach of the Undead</strong> is a survival-focused <strong>zombie defense</strong> game built around constant pressure and escalating danger. Your goal is simple: <strong>hold your ground, survive the waves, and last as long as possible.</strong> <br>But with every wave, the undead grow stronger, faster, and more ruthless.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using limited resources, you must build your defense, choose your weapons carefully, and adapt your strategy as endless zombie hordes breach your position. Fast-paced combat, dark atmosphere, and intense moments define the experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Wave-Based Zombie Attacks</strong> <br>Each wave introduces tougher and more aggressive enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308440/extras/dad768ddeb6da504d19c3ea6a29ce11c.poster.avif?t=1783588324\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308440/extras/dad768ddeb6da504d19c3ea6a29ce11c.webm?t=1783588324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308440/extras/dad768ddeb6da504d19c3ea6a29ce11c.mp4?t=1783588324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Weapons &amp; Defensive Tools</strong> <br>Multiple weapons and damage styles to fit different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308440/extras/b6784fa3153c1115bf668935a534fdca.poster.avif?t=1783588324\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308440/extras/b6784fa3153c1115bf668935a534fdca.webm?t=1783588324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308440/extras/b6784fa3153c1115bf668935a534fdca.mp4?t=1783588324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Dark and Tense Atmosphere</strong> <br>Sound, lighting, and environment design create constant tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308440/extras/5ab34db1f8095027a5b2bb46c523f0e3.poster.avif?t=1783588324\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308440/extras/5ab34db1f8095027a5b2bb46c523f0e3.webm?t=1783588324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308440/extras/5ab34db1f8095027a5b2bb46c523f0e3.mp4?t=1783588324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Smooth and Responsive Gameplay</strong> <br>Performance-focused mechanics with clear feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308440/extras/87f51b28e7bf7ac925643b3ba9402f75.poster.avif?t=1783588324\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308440/extras/87f51b28e7bf7ac925643b3ba9402f75.webm?t=1783588324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4308440/extras/87f51b28e7bf7ac925643b3ba9402f75.mp4?t=1783588324\"